title: Electoral Strategy
new-page: true
card-image: img/graphics/all_need_ccf.jpg
on-arrival: {!
    Q.party_contest_map = 'ccf';
    Q.month_actions += 1;

    for (party of Q.parties) {
        Q[party + '_contests'] = 0; 
    };

   Q.north_contests = window.electoral_strat('north', 'ccf');
   Q.central_contests = window.electoral_strat('central', 'ccf'); 
   Q.southwest_contests = window.electoral_strat('southwest', 'ccf'); 
   Q.southeast_contests = window.electoral_strat('southeast', 'ccf'); 
   Q.saskatoon_contests = window.electoral_strat('saskatoon', 'ccf'); 
   Q.regina_contests = window.electoral_strat('regina', 'ccf');  
   Q.moose_jaw_contests = window.electoral_strat('moose_jaw', 'ccf'); 
   if (Q.districts.prince_albert.seats > 0) {Q.prince_albert_contests = window.electoral_strat('prince_albert', 'ccf');}

   Q.electoral_strategy_timer = 1;

   Q.ccf_electoral_map = window.electoral_map('ccf');

!}
tags: electoral_affairs
is-card: true

= Electoral Strategy

The electoral system of Saskatchewan makes it possibly advantageous for parties to cooperate electorally. Parties can collaborate to nominate joint candidates and 'saw-off' their own candidates. Alternatively, running a full slate displays confidence and a better chance for a majority government. 

[+ ccf_electoral_map +] 



- @full_slate: Let's run a Full Slate!
- @ccf_electoral_strategy: Questions of [+ party_names.ccf +] Electoral Strategy
- @cps_strategy: What Electoral Options can we discuss with the Tories?
- @scps_strategy: Will Social Credit discuss Electoral Strategy with us?
- @cpc_s_strategy: The Communists may be willing to help us...
- @electoral_strategy_finished: We have finished our electoral preparations!

@full_slate
title: Let's run a Full Slate
subtitle: -3 resources
unavailable-subtitle: -3 resources, We should cancel our inter-party plans if we plan to run a full slate
on-arrival: {!
    Object.keys(Q.districts).forEach(district => {
        Q[district + '_ccf_rcr'] = 1; 
    });
!}
choose-if: cps_cooperation = 0 and scps_cooperation = 0 and cpc_s_cooperation = 0



###########################################################################3


@cps_strategy
unavailable-subtitle: They are not willing to entertain cooperation with us
choose-if: cps_relation >= 50
on-arrival: cps_election_planning = 1; party_contest_map = 'cps';

- @cps_saw_offs: Can we convince them to 'saw-off' candidates for us?

@cps_saw_offs
subtitle: Saw Off





######################################################

@scps_strategy
unavailable-subtitle: They are not willing to entertain cooperation with us
choose-if: scps_relation >= 70
on-arrival: scps_election_planning = 1;





########################################################


@cpc_s_strategy
unavailable-subtitle: They are not willing to entertain cooperation with us
choose-if: cpc_s_relation >= 60
on-arrival: cpc_s_election_planning = 1;

@electoral_strategy_finished
